e vr\u00e1tit zp\u011bt."],"URLs":["URL"],"Add section":["P\u0159idat sekci"],"Gallery":["Galerie"],"Delete":["Smazat"],"Add days and time slots. Each slot has time, title, speaker and room.":["P\u0159idejte dny a \u010dasov\u00e9 sloty. Ka\u017ed\u00fd slot m\u00e1 \u010das, n\u00e1zev, p\u0159edn\u00e1\u0161ej\u00edc\u00edho a m\u00edstnost."],"Create":["Vytvo\u0159it"],"Edit event app":[""],"Shown in the wallet and email (e.g. \"Opera evening\", \"Zoo visit\"). Empty = use the global default.":["Zobrazuje se v pen\u011b\u017eence a e-mailu (nap\u0159. \u201eVe\u010der v ope\u0159e\u201c, \u201eN\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bva ZOO\u201c). Pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9 = pou\u017e\u00edt glob\u00e1ln\u00ed v\u00fdchoz\u00ed."],"Active":["Aktivn\u00ed"],"Save the congress first to add pages and sections.":["Nejprve ulo\u017ete kongres, abyste mohli p\u0159idat str\u00e1nky a sekce."],"Add":["Pridat"],"Expired":["Vypr\u0161elo"],"Turn off to hide this congress everywhere (page + wallet) without unassigning it \u2014 e.g. to publish the info only later.":["Vypn\u011bte pro skryt\u00ed tohoto kongresu v\u0161ude (str\u00e1nka + pen\u011b\u017eenka) bez jeho odebr\u00e1n\u00ed \u2014 nap\u0159. pro pozd\u011bj\u0161\u00ed zve\u0159ejn\u011bn\u00ed informac\u00ed."],"Slug for new edition:":["Slug pro nov\u00e9 vyd\u00e1n\u00ed:"],"Add speaker":["P\u0159idat \u0159e\u010dn\u00edka"],"Title and slug are required.":["N\u00e1zev a slug jsou povinn\u00e9."],"Program":["Program"],"Updated":["Aktualizov\u00e1no"],"Products":["Produkty"],"Speaker":["\u0158e\u010dn\u00edk"],"Pick files from the media library. Label is shown to visitors. Drag to reorder.":["Vyberte soubory z medi\u00e1ln\u00ed knihovny. Popisek se zobraz\u00ed n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edk\u016fm. P\u0159eta\u017een\u00edm zm\u011bn\u00edte po\u0159ad\u00ed."],"Unique identifier for this congress. Visitors open it through their personal ticket link, not the slug.":["Unik\u00e1tn\u00ed identifik\u00e1tor tohoto kongresu. N\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edci jej otev\u0159ou p\u0159es sv\u016fj osobn\u00ed odkaz na vstupenku, nikoli p\u0159es slug."],"Choose":["Vybrat"],"Save congress":["Ulo\u017eit kongres"],"Delete page?":["Smazat str\u00e1nku?"],"Save":["Ulo\u017eit"],"Assign via the WooCommerce product settings.":["P\u0159i\u0159a\u010fte v nastaven\u00ed produktu WooCommerce."],"Internal":["Intern\u00ed"],"Insert variable\u2026":["Vlo\u017eit prom\u011bnnou\u2026"],"Files":["Soubory"],"Title":["N\u00e1zev"],"Cancel":["Zrusit"],"Choose image":["Vybrat obr\u00e1zek"],"Image":["Obr\u00e1zek"],"Manual hard cutoff. Leave empty for unlimited access.":["Manu\u00e1ln\u00ed pevn\u00fd konec. Pro neomezen\u00fd p\u0159\u00edstup ponechte pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9."],"Caption (optional)":["Popisek (voliteln\u00fd)"],"No pages yet. Add a page to start.":["Zat\u00edm \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 str\u00e1nky. P\u0159idejte str\u00e1nku pro za\u010d\u00e1tek."],"Portal label":["Popisek port\u00e1lu"],"assigned (manage on product level)":["p\u0159i\u0159azeno (spr\u00e1va na \u00farovni produktu)"],"Video":["Video"],"Icon":["Ikona"],"Drag to reorder":["P\u0159eta\u017een\u00edm zm\u011bn\u00edte po\u0159ad\u00ed"],"Room":["M\u00edstnost"],"Add URL":["P\u0159idat URL"],"Type":["Typ"],"Access expires (optional)":["Platnost p\u0159\u00edstupu (voliteln\u00e9)"],"Active \u2014 visible to ticket holders":["Aktivn\u00ed \u2014 viditeln\u00e9 pro dr\u017eitele vstupenek"],"Add page":["P\u0159idat str\u00e1nku"],"This action cannot be undone. All sections will be deleted as well.":["Tuto akci nelze vr\u00e1tit zp\u011bt. V\u0161echny sekce budou tak\u00e9 smaz\u00e1ny."],"Icon, optional image, card color and a short description shown on the page card.":["Ikona, voliteln\u00fd obr\u00e1zek, barva karty a kr\u00e1tk\u00fd popis zobrazen\u00fd na kart\u011b str\u00e1nky."],"Video file":["Video soubor"],"Title for new edition (leave empty to auto-generate):":["N\u00e1zev nov\u00e9ho vyd\u00e1n\u00ed (nechte pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9 pro automatick\u00e9 vygenerov\u00e1n\u00ed):"],"Paste a YouTube, Vimeo or other supported link. It is embedded automatically.":["Vlo\u017ete odkaz na YouTube, Vimeo nebo jin\u00fd podporovan\u00fd odkaz. Bude automaticky vlo\u017een."],"start page":["\u00favodn\u00ed str\u00e1nka"],"Name":["Nazev"],"Select video":["Vybrat video"],"Remove slot":["Odebrat slot"],"Add image":["P\u0159idat obr\u00e1zek"],"Remove image":["Odebrat obr\u00e1zek"],"Display size":["Velikost zobrazen\u00ed"],"Short description (max 160)":["Kr\u00e1tk\u00fd popis (max. 160)"],"Choose which page this section belongs to. Change it to move the section to another page.":["Vyberte, ke kter\u00e9 str\u00e1nce tato sekce pat\u0159\u00ed. Zm\u011bnou ji p\u0159esunete na jinou str\u00e1nku."],"Open full size when clicked":["Otev\u0159\u00edt v pln\u00e9 velikosti po kliknut\u00ed"],"Content":["Obsah"],"Video URL":["URL videa"],"Uploaded video file":["Nahran\u00fd video soubor"],"Select file":["Vybrat soubor"],"New event app":[""],"Full width":["Pln\u00e1 \u0161\u00ed\u0159ka"],"Card color":["Barva karty"],"Add slot":["P\u0159idat slot"],"Settings":["Nastaven\u00ed"],"Rename page":["P\u0159ejmenovat str\u00e1nku"],"Short bio (max 500 characters)":["Stru\u010dn\u00fd \u017eivotopis (max. 500 znak\u016f)"],"No icon":["Bez ikony"],"An event app is the companion page your visitors open with their ticket: programme and schedule, speaker or artist info, venue maps, downloads, media and support pages \u2014 everything structured in one place. Perfect for a congress with multiple sessions, but just as much for a single event where ticket holders need extra info, a FAQ or contact options. Visitors do not need an account or an extra app: their ticket ID is the key, access opens with the ticket and can expire with it. Assign an event app to a product in the WooCommerce product settings \u2014 one app can serve multiple products, so an event series shares one app.":[""],"Source":["Zdroj"],"Export contacts":["Exportovat kontakty"],"Edit":["Upravit"],"Page":["Str\u00e1nka"],"Updated:":["Aktualizov\u00e1no:"],"Time":["\u010cas"],"Open inline":["Otev\u0159\u00edt v textu"],"Images":["Obr\u00e1zky"],"Add file":["P\u0159idat soubor"]}}}